#: ../../reference/identity-and-naming.md:1
msgid "Identity and naming"
msgstr "Azonosság és elnevezés"

#: ../../reference/identity-and-naming.md:3
msgid ""
"The Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria (AEAT) is the external "
"tax authority. CLI means command-line interface. MCP means Model Context "
"Protocol."
msgstr ""
"Az Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria (AEAT) a külső "
"adóhatóság. A CLI a parancssori felületet jelenti. Az MCP a Model Context"
" Protocolt jelenti."

